## Pre-PR Audit — REQUIRED Before Every `gh pr create`

Run both audits on every modified component or page file before opening a PR. Fix every finding first. Zero output = clear to open.

### i18n audit — catch hardcoded English strings

```bash
# For each modified component/page file, check for hardcoded strings
git diff --name-only origin/dev | grep -E "^(components|app/\[locale\])" | while read f; do
  HITS=$(grep -nE 'toast\(["'"'"'][A-Z]|toast\.(error|success|warning)\(["'"'"'][A-Z]|aria-label=["'"'"'][A-Za-z]|placeholder=["'"'"'][A-Za-z]' "$f" 2>/dev/null | grep -v 't("' | grep -v 'tCommon(' | grep -v 'tFeedback(' | grep -v '\.t\.')
  [ -n "$HITS" ] && echo "=== HARDCODED STRINGS in $f ===" && echo "$HITS"
done
```

Any output = hardcoded string that must become a `messages/` key. Fix before committing.

### CSS color audit — catch hardcoded color values

```bash
# For each modified component/page file, check for hardcoded colors in style props
git diff --name-only origin/dev | grep -E "^(components|app/\[locale\])" | while read f; do
  HITS=$(grep -nE "style=.*#[0-9a-fA-F]{3,}|style=.*rgba?\(|animation:.*spin|animation:.*\"spin" "$f" 2>/dev/null | grep -v "var(--")
  [ -n "$HITS" ] && echo "=== HARDCODED COLORS in $f ===" && echo "$HITS"
done
```

Any output = hardcoded color or spin animation that must be a CSS variable (`var(--...)`) or `className="animate-spin"`. Fix before committing. If it is a genuine exception (e.g. fullscreen dark-overlay UI), document it in `COPILOT_LEARNINGS.md` before the PR opens — never leave it undocumented.

### Both audits must show zero output before the PR is opened. No exceptions.

